 "The Stands": "看台",
 "<i>Species: Nāgá.</i> “Cherished companions of Flavius, these serpents become formidable contenders, embodying the essence of Asclepius, ensuring a ceaseless crimson cascade upon the arena sands.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Virgilante, ludus notes</span>": "<i>物种：Nāgá。</i>「这些蛇是Flavius珍爱的伙伴，化身Asclepius的精髓，成为难缠的对手，令竞技场的沙地上血流不止。」<span class=\"rc-sub\">——Virgilante，ludus笔记</span>",
 "<i>Species: Canis lupus.</i> “Valencia and Moechus, masters of the hunt, possess an insatiable appetite within the arena, their natural prowess and docility allowing them to effortlessly track their prey.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Cassius Dio, ludus notes</span>": "<i>物种：Canis lupus。</i>「狩猎大师Valencia与Moechus在竞技场中胃口永无餍足，天生的本领与温顺让它们毫不费力地追踪猎物。」<span class=\"rc-sub\">——Cassius Dio，ludus笔记</span>",
 "<i>Species: Atlas.</i> “Ursa may hold the upper paw, but do not underestimate the thunderous might of Brutum. Beware, for crossing their paths means daring to challenge their dominion, even at the cost of their cherished treasure.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Pomponius Mela, ludus notes</span>": "<i>物种：Atlas。</i>「Ursa或许更占上风，但切莫小看Brutum雷霆般的力量。当心，挡它们的路就是挑战它们的统治，哪怕要赔上它们珍爱的宝物。」<span class=\"rc-sub\">——Pomponius Mela，ludus笔记</span>",
 "<i>Species: Barbary Lion.</i> “Transported clandestinely across the treacherous Mediterranean during the frigid grip of last winter’s mare clausum, these untamed exotic beasts ignite a frenzy of excitement within the crowd as they unleash their primal fury, tearing limbs asunder and delivering savage face-maulings.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Pomponius Mela, ludus notes</span>": "<i>物种：Barbary Lion。</i>「去年冬天mare clausum的严寒之中，这些未被驯服的异域野兽被秘密运过凶险的地中海；它们释放原始的狂怒，撕裂四肢、猛扑撕咬面孔，令观众陷入狂热。」<span class=\"rc-sub\">——Pomponius Mela，ludus笔记</span>",
 "<i>Species: unknown.</i> “With its otherworldly visage and unparalleled brutality, Tholo stands as a living testament to the extraordinary and the unfathomable, seizing the gaze of spectators from across the empire, instilling fear that resonates within their souls.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Virgilante, ludus notes</span>": "<i>物种：不明。</i>「Tholo有着超凡脱俗的面容和无与伦比的残暴，是非凡与不可测度之物的活见证，吸引着帝国各地观众的目光，令恐惧在他们灵魂深处回荡。」<span class=\"rc-sub\">——Virgilante，ludus笔记</span>",
 "<i>Species: Human.</i> “Master of deception and self-proclaimed Champion Victorious, Commodus, a consummate fabricator, forges a path devoid of allies, shamelessly usurping the title within the realms of Flavius Rule.” <span class=\"rc-sub\">— Cassius Dio, ludus notes</span>": "<i>物种：人类。</i>「欺骗大师、自封Champion Victorious的Commodus是个十足的捏造者，他走在一条没有盟友的路上，在Flavius Rule的疆域中厚颜无耻地篡夺头衔。」<span class=\"rc-sub\">——Cassius Dio，ludus笔记</span>",
 "The golden eagle of the games: too fast to hit, too proud to land, happiest carrying off something a gladiator was about to enjoy.": "角斗中的金雕：快得打不中，傲得不落地，最乐于叼走角斗士正要享用的东西。",
